  "title": "支撑利亚姆·劳森“拯救生涯”一季的亮眼数据",
  "summary": "劳森的稳定输出，如何让他在2026赛季成为Racing Bulls阵中极具价值的资产。",
  "cover_url": "https://cdn-6.motorsport.com/images/amp/6grQG3nY/s1200/liam-lawson-racing-bulls.webp",
  "published_at": "2026-11-12T12:42:31+00:00",
